  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Assist Ministry of Transportation in Execution of Regional Road Plan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Asistencia Tcnica Ministerio de Transporte para la Ejecucin Plan Vial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Asistir al MT en el desarrollo de las herramientas tcnicas e institucionales que le permitan brindar un apoyo eficiente a los departamentos en su gestin vial y de transporte.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To assist the MT in developing the technical and institutional tools in order for it to become an efficient actor in providing support to the departments in their road and transport management.</narrative>
  </description>
